# with a name, only the lines carrying name=<it> or person=<it> (case and surrounding spaces ignored), followed by
# the matching lines of each of the sheet's descendants (sheets by id, each newest first), and when the name
# is (a name or alias of) a person transferred in, after them the lines about them on the sheet they came from (under
# the name they had there), newest first, as that sheet's file holds them.
